--- a/arch/arm/mach-snapdragon/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-snapdragon/Kconfig
@@ -64,5 +64,9 @@ config QCOM_BOOT_MENU
 	  an Android boot image with an arm64 kernel. qcom_reboot_mode
 	  stores ABL's reboot reason (recovery or bootloader) in the DT's
 	  nvmem-reboot-mode cell, reads it back and resets.
+	  qcom_android_chain boots the Android kernel of a partition (an
